      "side": 1,
      "message": "This needs a comment to explain why it\u0027s not just using system_current. I\u0027d suggest:\n\nThe mDNS code is platform code so it should use framework-annotations-lib, contrary to apps that should use sdk_version: \"system_current\" and only androidx.annotation_annotation. But this build rule verifies that the mDNS code can be built into apps, if code transformations are applied to the annotations.\n\nWhen using \"system_current\", framework annotations are not available; they would appear as package-private as they are marked as such in the system_current stubs. So build against core_platform and add the stubs manually in \"libs\". See http://b/147773144#comment7.",
      "revId": "90c60b8af1d1eaba762d4bb51ad7b0a1e9c7b669",
